OL,3,GNEWSA'New life' breathed into two pubs
OL,4,Aafter revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Shropshire pubs have reopened after
OL,7,Fthey were both closed for about two
OL,8,Fyears.
OL,10,FThe Three Fishes in Bayston Hill was
OL,11,Fbadly damaged when a lorry crashed into
OL,12,Fit in November 2024, while the Grade
OL,13,FII-listed Bridge Inn in Newport
OL,14,Freopened on Thursday after an
OL,15,F"extensive" refurbishment.
OL,17,FOwned by Black Country Ales, The Three
OL,18,FFishes has undergone a two-year
OL,19,Frestoration programme, while local
OL,20,Ffamily business Rowton Brewery bought
OL,21,Fthe Bridge Inn 18 months ago.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
