OL,3,GNEWSA'New life' breathed into two pubs
OL,4,Aafter revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Preston, who co-owns Rowton
OL,7,FBrewery with his brother Peter, said:
OL,8,F"It's all about bringing these old pubs
OL,9,Fback, bringing some life back into
OL,10,Fthese old pubs."
